{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"羅馬書","commonName":"羅馬書","title":"羅馬書","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"f560c474555cc22353f7bb93dfa2f9103b88816017ae271ebc73851cc8c479f1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["順服掌權者"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["在上有權柄的，人人當順服他，因為沒有權柄不是出於上帝的。凡掌權的都是上帝所命的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["所以，抗拒掌權的就是抗拒上帝的命；抗拒的必自取刑罰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["作官的原不是叫行善的懼怕，乃是叫作惡的懼怕。你願意不懼怕掌權的嗎？你只要行善，就可得他的稱讚；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為他是上帝的用人，是與你有益的。你若作惡，卻當懼怕，因為他不是空空地佩劍；他是上帝的用人，是伸冤的，刑罰那作惡的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["所以，你們必須順服，不但是因為刑罰，也是因為良心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你們納糧，也為這個緣故；因他們是上帝的差役，常常特管這事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["凡人所當得的，就給他。當得糧的，給他納糧；當得稅的，給他上稅；當懼怕的，懼怕他；當恭敬的，恭敬他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["相愛如兄弟"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["凡事都不可虧欠人，惟有彼此相愛要常以為虧欠，因為愛人的就完全了律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["像那不可姦淫，不可殺人，不可偷盜，不可貪婪，或有別的誡命，都包在愛人如己這一句話之內了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["愛是不加害與人的，所以愛就完全了律法。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["白晝將近"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["再者，你們曉得，現今就是該趁早睡醒的時候；因為我們得救，現今比初信的時候更近了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["黑夜已深，白晝將近。我們就當脫去暗昧的行為，帶上光明的兵器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["行事為人要端正，好像行在白晝。不可荒宴醉酒；不可好色邪蕩；不可爭競嫉妒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["總要披戴主耶穌基督，不要為肉體安排，去放縱私慾。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}